  WP-A: Laboratory Governance Security & Access Repairs
    1. Cross-Lab Staff Actions & Role Hierarchy (A01, A02, A03, LG-01, LG-03)
      √ A01: Manager A cannot reset password of staff in Lab B (403 Forbidden) (10 ms)
      √ A01: Manager A cannot toggle staff active state in Lab B (403 Forbidden) (7 ms)
      √ A02: Manager A cannot reset password of another manager in Lab A (403 Forbidden) (8 ms)
      √ A03: Manager A CAN reset password of subordinate technician in Lab A; increments tokenVersion and returns random password (105 ms)
      √ A03: Viewer user cannot reset staff password (403 Forbidden) (9 ms)
    2. Lab Update Allowlist & Lifecycle Mutation Protection (A07, LG-02, LG-04, LG-05, A33)
      √ A07: Lab PUT rejects attempts to inject immutable fields (id, isActive, createdAt) (7 ms)
      √ A07: Lab PUT succeeds with allowlisted fields and does not alter immutable ID (8 ms)
      √ A01: Manager A cannot update Lab B via PUT (403 Forbidden) (7 ms)
      √ LG-04: Non-admin cannot create a laboratory via POST /api/labs (403 Forbidden) (6 ms)
      √ A33: Inactive lab technician can access /api/auth/me for read/history access with labIsActive=false (IR-10) (6 ms)
    3. User Administration, Last-Admin Protection & Validation (A08, A09, A10, LG-06, LG-07, LG-08)
      √ A09: Administrator self-deletion is prevented (SELF_DELETION_FORBIDDEN) (6 ms)
      √ LG-07: User creation rejects foreign labId for manager (403 Forbidden) (5 ms)
      √ LG-07: User update rejects empty string role (5 ms)
      √ LG-08: National user getUsers returns only staff in national country labs (7 ms)
      √ LG-08: National user with empty country scope receives empty array (not global leak) (5 ms)
    4. Project Scoping & Kobo Credential Redaction (A24, A27, LG-11, LG-13, LG-27)
      √ A27: Kobo configuration endpoint redacts API token (LG-13) (7 ms)
      √ A24: Manager of another lab cannot delete project (LG-11) (4 ms)
    5. Equipment Scoping & Management Isolation (A30, LG-18)
      √ A30: Manager A cannot change equipment status in Lab B (403 Forbidden) (4 ms)
    6. Offline Synchronization & Work Pack Scoping (A16, A17, A18, A19, LG-14, LG-15)
      √ A18: Viewer cannot complete work via sync batch (LG-14) (2 ms)
      √ A18: Technician B cannot complete Lab A work item via sync batch (1 ms)
      √ A19: SAVE_WORK_DRAFT persists to WorkItemDraft table and returns APPLIED (20 ms)
      √ A17: Non-admin without labId is denied work pack preparation (LG-15) (41 ms)
    7. Session Revocation & Impersonation Safety (A13, A14, LG-16, LG-28)
      √ A13: Stale tokenVersion is rejected by HTTP auth with 401 SESSION_INVALIDATED (4 ms)
      √ A14: Impersonated session is invalidated when actor administrator is deactivated (9 ms)
    8. Timezone Intervals & DST Calculation (A37, LG-29)
      √ A37: Europe/London spring-forward DST (2026-03-29) produces exactly 23 hours (2 ms)
      √ A37: Europe/London fall-back DST (2026-10-25) produces exactly 25 hours (1 ms)
      √ A04: National user cannot switch dashboard scope to an out-of-country lab (2 ms)
    9. Global Locale Management Protection (A32, LG-20)
      √ A32: Core platform locales (en, es, es-419, fr, pt) cannot be deleted (4 ms)
      √ A32: Ordinary lab manager cannot delete languages (403 Forbidden) (4 ms)

